This is the Android application.  I think I
will aim to support down to Android SDK 23,
between Android 6.0, "Marshmallow" (2015-16)
and Android 7.0, "Nougat" (2016-17).  This is
so that it can be used jointly with the "blob"
emojis before it was replaced in Android 8.0.

I'm not sure if that's doable, or if I could
get a hold of such a device.  But we'll see...
